Croc is a horror, action, tv movie film directed by Stewart Raffill.

3
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:51,000
A large man-eating crocodile terrorizes tourists
and locals near Krabi, in Thailand.

4
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Michael Madsen plays a hunter stalking the immense reptile, while sub-plots include a rivalry between a foreigner, who
owns a crocodile-farm, and a Thai man who plays a part in framing the foreigner for the crocodile's rampage.

