11
01:08:45,000 --> 01:08:51,000
Croc is a 2007 American made-for-television natural horror film produced by RHI Entertainment that
premiered in Canada on the video-on-demand channel Movie Central On Demand in July 2007.

12
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
It aired in the United States on the Sci Fi Channel on November 4, 2007.

13
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:21,000
Croc is the sixth film in the Maneater film series
produced under an agreement with Sci Fi.

14
01:27:30,000 --> 01:27:36,000
Filmed in Thailand, the film revolves around the efforts of the owner of a crocodile-farm, an animal welfare agent,
and a hunter trying to kill a large saltwater crocodile that has begun killing people in the area.

